Map {
  "0.0.0" => "Get out of my way, boy.",
  "0.1.0" => "How noble. Enjoy your shared grave.",
  "0.2.0" => "Oh no...",
  "0.3.0" => "Could you be...?",
  "0.4.0" => "Volga",
  "0.5.0" => "Volga",
  "0.6.0" => "Impa",
  "0.7.0" => "Impa",
  "1.0.0" => "We can't locate Princess Zelda.
I pray she's safe...",
  "1.1.0" => "I must ask for your help in finding her.
I trust you are willing?",
  "1.2.0" => "Link, be a hero worthy of wearing this tunic.",
  "1.3.0" => "Impa",
  "1.4.0" => "Impa",
  "1.5.0" => "Impa",
  "2.1.0" => "The princess isn't dead.",
  "2.2.0" => "You'll reunite with her at some point during your
journey, but not quite yet.",
  "2.3.0" => "You can call me...Sheik.",
  "2.4.0" => "It's a name that comes from the Sheikah tribe.
They were servants of the Hyrulean Royal Family.",
  "2.5.0" => "The Sheikah tribe?",
  "2.6.0" => "That's impossible...",
  "2.7.0" => "We can talk more once we get out of
this cave. For now, let me join you!",
  "2.8.0" => "???",
  "2.9.0" => "???",
  "2.10.0" => "Sheik",
  "2.11.0" => "Sheik",
  "2.12.0" => "Impa",
  "2.13.0" => "Impa",
  "2.14.0" => "Sheik",
  "3.1.0" => "You...",
  "3.2.0" => "Are you the one leading these warriors?",
  "3.3.0" => "Yes, I am.",
  "3.4.0" => "You can use magic. Where did you
learn your craft?",
  "3.5.0" => "Oh, well...
I'm a sorceress.",
  "3.6.0" => "You know the one who started this war? Cia?
We come from the same magical clan.",
  "3.7.0" => "Ah, well that explains it...",
  "3.8.0" => "And what does this "Cia" want from Hyrule?",
  "3.9.0" => "You really want to know?",
  "3.10.0" => "Well...",
  "3.11.0" => "Help me defend the forest.",
  "3.12.0" => "If you do that, I might tell you.",
  "3.13.0" => "Lana",
  "3.14.0" => "Impa",
  "3.15.0" => "Lana",
  "3.16.0" => "Impa",
  "3.17.0" => "Lana",
  "3.18.0" => "Lana",
  "3.19.0" => "Impa",
  "3.20.0" => "Impa",
  "3.21.0" => "Lana",
  "3.22.0" => "Lana",
  "3.23.0" => "Lana",
  "3.24.0" => "Lana",
  "4.1.0" => "I hoped Zelda would be here...
Apparently that hope was in vain.",
  "4.2.0" => "Where could she be? Is she safe?
May the goddesses protect her...",
  "4.3.0" => "Impa",
  "4.4.0" => "Impa",
  "5.0.0" => "Oh?",
  "5.1.0" => "Ah, Link, the great hero...
Let me get a good look at you...",
  "5.2.0" => "The Triforce is resonating so powerfully...",
  "5.3.0" => "Link!",
  "5.4.0" => "Two...",
  "5.5.0" => "Ah, I see...",
  "5.6.0" => "That's certainly welcome news...",
  "5.7.0" => "Come forth, servant!",
  "5.8.0" => "Cia",
  "5.9.0" => "Cia",
  "5.10.0" => "Cia",
  "5.11.0" => "Sheik",
  "5.12.0" => "Cia",
  "5.13.0" => "Cia",
  "5.14.0" => "Cia",
  "5.15.0" => "Cia",
  "6.0.0" => "Sheik! That's--!",
  "6.1.0" => "Ha ha ha... How nice of you to bring me the Triforce of
Wisdom as well!",
  "6.2.0" => "That means I have all three pieces...",
  "6.3.0" => "Behold...the awesome majesty of the completed Triforce!",
  "6.4.0" => "No!
Link, run!",
  "6.5.0" => "Cia...",
  "6.6.0" => "The time to call the fragments of my spirit is NOW.",
  "6.7.0" => "Yes... I can feel them seeking me out...",
  "6.8.0" => "HaaaaaAAAAAHHH!",
  "6.9.0" => "Lana",
  "6.10.0" => "Cia",
  "6.11.0" => "Cia",
  "6.12.0" => "Cia",
  "6.13.0" => "Lana",
  "6.14.0" => "???",
  "6.15.0" => "???",
  "6.16.0" => "Cia",
  "6.17.0" => "Cia",
  "7.0.0" => "You could have accompanied either Link or Lana.
Why did you choose to follow me?",
  "7.1.0" => "I can't figure you out... How much do you really know
of the Sheikah tribe?",
  "7.2.0" => "Tell me. Who is your tribe's leader?",
  "7.3.0" => "Impa, which would be you.",
  "7.4.0" => "Correct. And yet there is no one named Sheik in my tribe...",
  "7.5.0" => "So then, who does that make you?
What are you really after?",
  "7.6.0" => "Hey! Listen! Princess Ruto is in trouble!",
  "7.7.0" => "Ruto, Princess of the Zoras?",
  "7.8.0" => "She was abducted by the Gorons!",
  "7.9.0" => "Their leader Darunia used
to be such a gentle soul...",
  "7.10.0" => "Someone named Zelda showed up and...
he hasn't been the same since!",
  "7.11.0" => "Zelda? Princess Zelda is here?",
  "7.12.0" => "Let's go and see with our own eyes.",
  "7.13.0" => "Impa",
  "7.14.0" => "Impa",
  "7.15.0" => "Impa",
  "7.16.0" => "Sheik",
  "7.17.0" => "Impa",
  "7.18.0" => "Impa",
  "7.19.0" => "Fairy",
  "7.20.0" => "Sheik",
  "7.21.0" => "Fairy",
  "7.22.0" => "Fairy",
  "7.23.0" => "Fairy",
  "7.24.0" => "Impa",
  "7.25.0" => "Sheik",
  "8.0.0" => "How did you see through my disguise?",
  "8.1.0" => "You can't be Zelda.",
  "8.2.0" => "Because...",
  "8.3.0" => "I am Zelda!",
  "8.4.0" => "Princess! You're alive!",
  "8.5.0" => "Impa, forgive me for not telling you.",
  "8.6.0" => "Let us close this gate together.",
  "8.7.0" => "Wizzro",
  "8.8.0" => "Sheik",
  "8.9.0" => "Sheik",
  "8.10.0" => "Zelda",
  "8.11.0" => "Impa",
  "8.12.0" => "Zelda",
  "8.13.0" => "Zelda",
  "9.0.0" => "D-don't squish me!",
  "9.1.0" => "Arrrgh!",
  "9.2.0" => "Close one...",
  "9.3.0" => "Are you all right?",
  "9.4.0" => "Yes! And who might you be?",
  "9.5.0" => "I'm Lana.",
  "9.6.0" => "I'm looking for the Gate of Souls.
I just...don't know where to look...",
  "9.7.0" => "Gate of Souls...?
Never seen one before.",
  "9.8.0" => "But I can take you right to where you want to go!",
  "9.9.0" => "Um... How would you do that?",
  "9.10.0" => "With this Goddess Butterfly, of course!
It will guide us through the Twilight Realm.",
  "9.11.0" => "Villager",
  "9.12.0" => "Villager",
  "9.13.0" => "Lana",
  "9.14.0" => "Lana",
  "9.15.0" => "Villager",
  "9.16.0" => "Lana",
  "9.17.0" => "Lana",
  "9.18.0" => "Agitha",
  "9.19.0" => "Agitha",
  "9.20.0" => "Lana",
  "9.21.0" => "Agitha",
  "10.0.0" => "Let it go!
That insect is important!",
  "10.1.0" => "Why? So it can fly around and spread poison on my forces?",
  "10.2.0" => "What?",
  "10.3.0" => "Actually, the butterfly you see now is not of a poisonous
genus, I can assure you!",
  "10.4.0" => "Genus...?",
  "10.5.0" => "This is a Goddess Butterfly.",
  "10.6.0" => "If you ask it kindly, it will guide you anywhere you want
to go. Isn't that nice?",
  "10.7.0" => "Guide me anywhere, huh?",
  "10.8.0" => "Hey! Butterfly!
Take me to that ugly witch!",
  "10.9.0" => "Oh my... Whatever should we do?",
  "10.10.0" => "Guess we'll just have to fight it out.",
  "10.11.0" => "Lana",
  "10.12.0" => "Midna",
  "10.13.0" => "Lana",
  "10.14.0" => "Agitha",
  "10.15.0" => "Midna",
  "10.16.0" => "Agitha",
  "10.17.0" => "Agitha",
  "10.18.0" => "Midna",
  "10.19.0" => "Midna",
  "10.20.0" => "Agitha",
  "10.21.0" => "Lana",
  "11.0.0" => "Lana? Whatever are you doing here?",
  "11.1.0" => "Cia--!",
  "11.2.0" => "She's the one! I'm cursed to look like this because of HER!",
  "11.3.0" => "Well, if I may say, that look suits you. Quite
fitting for a big-headed princess of Twilight...",
  "11.4.0" => "You--!",
  "11.5.0" => "Aaaagghh!",
  "11.6.0" => "Haaaaa...",
  "11.7.0" => "Lana, her face... It looks just like yours...",
  "11.8.0" => "I am Cia's...other half. She and I were once the same person.",
  "11.9.0" => "WHAT?!",
  "11.10.0" => "Cia",
  "11.11.0" => "Lana",
  "11.12.0" => "Midna",
  "11.13.0" => "Cia",
  "11.14.0" => "Midna",
  "11.15.0" => "Cia",
  "11.16.0" => "Cia",
  "11.17.0" => "Midna",
  "11.18.0" => "Lana",
  "11.19.0" => "Midna",
  "12.0.0" => "My name is Fi.
I was waiting for you.",
  "12.1.0" => "You are not the Master, but I can consider you a Master.",
  "12.2.0" => "My mission is to serve you.",
  "12.3.0" => "My assistance is necessary for your success.",
  "12.4.0" => "Shall I accompany you?",
  "12.5.0" => "Fi",
  "12.6.0" => "Fi",
  "12.7.0" => "Fi",
  "12.8.0" => "Fi",
  "12.9.0" => "Fi",
  "13.0.0" => "Oh, has the enemy figured out my plans?",
  "13.1.0" => "How unpleasant!",
  "13.2.0" => "Truthfully, I feel annoyed.",
  "13.3.0" => "If they can't learn to follow my direction...
then I shall do away with them!",
  "13.4.0" => "Ghirahim",
  "13.5.0" => "Ghirahim",
  "13.6.0" => "Ghirahim",
  "13.7.0" => "Ghirahim",
  "14.0.0" => "Master, raise your sword skyward, and then swing it down.",
  "14.1.0" => "Fi",
  "15.0.0" => "I see that your Triforce has returned...",
  "15.1.0" => "Yes. Mine, and Link's, too...",
  "15.2.0" => "It's not clear exactly how, but Cia's powers should be
a lot weaker.",
  "15.3.0" => "If we're going to counterattack, we've got to do it now!",
  "15.4.0" => "Cia still holds the Triforce of Power.",
  "15.5.0" => "She won't be overtaken so easily...",
  "15.6.0" => "No. We can win.
As long as we have the Master Sword.",
  "15.7.0" => "I believe Link possesses the spirit necessary to wield it.",
  "15.8.0" => "But, Princess...the Master Sword is more than just
a weapon--it's a barrier.",
  "15.9.0" => "It keeps a fragment of evil locked away.
Once pulled, the spirit will be freed...",
  "15.10.0" => "The barriers surrounding the Temple of the Sacred Sword
are made with a special type of magic.",
  "15.11.0" => "Pulling the Master Sword alone won't undo the barrier.
Not entirely, anyway.",
  "15.12.0" => "How can we be sure that Link is truly ready for this task?",
  "15.13.0" => "Because I believe in him.",
  "15.14.0" => "I believe in him too!",
  "15.15.0" => "Well, Link, if you were looking for a chance to prove yourself,
this would be it.",
  "15.16.0" => "Then we make haste for the Temple of the Sacred Sword.",
  "15.17.0" => "Lana",
  "15.18.0" => "Zelda",
  "15.19.0" => "Lana",
  "15.20.0" => "Lana",
  "15.21.0" => "Impa",
  "15.22.0" => "Impa",
  "15.23.0" => "Zelda",
  "15.24.0" => "Zelda",
  "15.25.0" => "Impa",
  "15.26.0" => "Impa",
  "15.27.0" => "Lana",
  "15.28.0" => "Lana",
  "15.29.0" => "Impa",
  "15.30.0" => "Zelda",
  "15.31.0" => "Lana",
  "15.32.0" => "Impa",
  "15.33.0" => "Zelda",
  "16.0.0" => "Tried hiding from me? Little brat...",
  "16.1.0" => "You fool!",
  "16.2.0" => "Wizzro",
  "16.3.0" => "Wizzro",
  "17.0.0" => "A sword is just a tool for the weak to swing around.
Only fools and men put confidence in them.",
  "17.1.0" => "Arrogance... Ego... Pridefulness...",
  "17.2.0" => "This darkness nurtured within you...",
  "17.3.0" => "shall be your undoing!",
  "17.4.0" => "Cia",
  "17.5.0" => "Cia",
  "17.6.0" => "Cia",
  "17.7.0" => "Cia",
  "18.0.0" => "Stand firm, Link!",
  "18.1.0" => "Real strength only comes from knowing your weaknesses!",
  "18.2.0" => "Lana",
  "18.3.0" => "Impa",
  "19.1.0" => "Uaaahhh!",
  "19.2.0" => "Allow me...to teach you a lesson!",
  "19.3.0" => "Hnnnnn...!",
  "19.4.0" => "Cia! Stop! Your spirit can't take much more of this!",
  "19.5.0" => "Cia",
  "19.6.0" => "Cia",
  "19.7.0" => "Cia",
  "19.8.0" => "Lana",
  "20.0.0" => "Follow my every command, or else perish again.",
  "20.1.0" => "Come. The Triforce shall be MINE!",
  "20.2.0" => "Ganondorf",
  "20.3.0" => "Ganondorf",
  "21.0.0" => "At last... All three pieces...",
  "21.1.0" => "Heh...",
  "21.2.0" => "HA HA HA HA!",
  "21.3.0" => "Ganondorf",
  "21.4.0" => "Ganondorf",
  "21.5.0" => "Ganondorf",
  "22.0.0" => "Grant my wish!",
  "22.1.0" => "Help! Everybody!",
  "22.2.0" => "Lana",
  "22.3.0" => "Lana",
  "181.0.0" => "Ha ha ha ha ha!",
  "181.1.0" => "I am the Great Fairy who serves the goddess.
I will grant you that which you wish for.",
  "181.2.0" => "Great Fairy",
  "181.3.0" => "Great Fairy",
  "182.0.0" => "Get out of my way, boy.",
  "182.1.0" => "How noble. Enjoy your shared grave.",
  "182.2.0" => "Oh no...",
  "182.3.0" => "Could you be...?",
  "182.4.0" => "Volga",
  "182.5.0" => "Volga",
  "182.6.0" => "Impa",
  "182.7.0" => "Impa",
  "183.0.0" => "We can't locate Princess Zelda.
I pray she's safe...",
  "183.1.0" => "I must ask for your help in finding her.
I trust you are willing?",
  "183.2.0" => "Link, be a hero worthy of wearing this tunic.",
  "183.3.0" => "Impa",
  "183.4.0" => "Impa",
  "183.5.0" => "Impa",
  "184.1.0" => "The princess isn't dead.",
  "184.2.0" => "You'll reunite with her at some point during your
journey, but not quite yet.",
  "184.3.0" => "You can call me...Sheik.",
  "184.4.0" => "It's a name that comes from the Sheikah tribe.
They were servants of the Hyrulean Royal Family.",
  "184.5.0" => "The Sheikah tribe?",
  "184.6.0" => "That's impossible...",
  "184.7.0" => "We can talk more once we get out of
this cave. For now, let me join you!",
  "184.8.0" => "???",
