  "185.1.0" => "You...",
  "185.2.0" => "Are you the one leading these warriors?",
  "185.3.0" => "Yes, I am.",
  "185.4.0" => "You can use magic. Where did you
learn your craft?",
  "185.5.0" => "Oh, well...
I'm a sorceress.",
  "185.6.0" => "You know the one who started this war? Cia?
We come from the same magical clan.",
  "185.7.0" => "Ah, well that explains it...",
  "185.8.0" => "And what does this "Cia" want from Hyrule?",
  "185.9.0" => "You really want to know?",
  "185.10.0" => "Well...",
  "185.11.0" => "Help me defend the forest.",
  "185.12.0" => "If you do that, I might tell you.",
  "185.13.0" => "Lana",
  "185.14.0" => "Impa",
  "185.15.0" => "Lana",
  "185.16.0" => "Impa",
  "185.17.0" => "Lana",
