  "189.7.0" => "Ruto, Princess of the Zoras?",
  "189.8.0" => "She was abducted by the Gorons!",
  "189.9.0" => "Their leader Darunia used
to be such a gentle soul...",
  "189.10.0" => "Someone named Zelda showed up and...
he hasn't been the same since!",
  "189.11.0" => "Zelda? Princess Zelda is here?",
  "189.12.0" => "Let's go and see with our own eyes.",
  "189.13.0" => "Impa",
  "189.14.0" => "Impa",
  "189.15.0" => "Impa",
  "189.16.0" => "Sheik",
  "189.17.0" => "Impa",
