  "189.22.0" => "Fairy",
  "189.23.0" => "Fairy",
  "189.24.0" => "Impa",
  "189.25.0" => "Sheik",
  "190.0.0" => "How did you see through my disguise?",
  "190.1.0" => "You can't be Zelda.",
  "190.2.0" => "Because...",
  "190.3.0" => "I am Zelda!",
  "190.4.0" => "Princess! You're alive!",
  "190.5.0" => "Impa, forgive me for not telling you.",
  "190.6.0" => "Let us close this gate together.",
  "190.7.0" => "Wizzro",
  "190.8.0" => "Sheik",
  "190.9.0" => "Sheik",
  "190.10.0" => "Zelda",
  "190.11.0" => "Impa",
  "190.12.0" => "Zelda",
  "190.13.0" => "Zelda",
  "191.0.0" => "D-don't squish me!",
  "191.1.0" => "Arrrgh!",
  "191.2.0" => "Close one...",
  "191.3.0" => "Are you all right?",
  "191.4.0" => "Yes! And who might you be?",
  "191.5.0" => "I'm Lana.",
  "191.6.0" => "I'm looking for the Gate of Souls.
I just...don't know where to look...",
  "191.7.0" => "Gate of Souls...?
Never seen one before.",
  "191.8.0" => "But I can take you right to where you want to go!",
  "191.9.0" => "Um... How would you do that?",
  "191.10.0" => "With this Goddess Butterfly, of course!
It will guide us through the Twilight Realm.",
  "191.11.0" => "Villager",
  "191.12.0" => "Villager",
  "191.13.0" => "Lana",
  "191.14.0" => "Lana",
  "191.15.0" => "Villager",
  "191.16.0" => "Lana",
  "191.17.0" => "Lana",
  "191.18.0" => "Agitha",
  "191.19.0" => "Agitha",
  "191.20.0" => "Lana",
  "191.21.0" => "Agitha",
  "192.0.0" => "Let it go!
That insect is important!",
  "192.1.0" => "Why? So it can fly around and spread poison on my forces?",
  "192.2.0" => "What?",
  "192.3.0" => "Actually, the butterfly you see now is not of a poisonous
genus, I can assure you!",
  "192.4.0" => "Genus...?",
  "192.5.0" => "This is a Goddess Butterfly.",
  "192.6.0" => "If you ask it kindly, it will guide you anywhere you want
to go. Isn't that nice?",
  "192.7.0" => "Guide me anywhere, huh?",
  "192.8.0" => "Hey! Butterfly!
Take me to that ugly witch!",
  "192.9.0" => "Oh my... Whatever should we do?",
  "192.10.0" => "Guess we'll just have to fight it out.",
  "192.11.0" => "Lana",
  "192.12.0" => "Midna",
  "192.13.0" => "Lana",
  "192.14.0" => "Agitha",
  "192.15.0" => "Midna",
  "192.16.0" => "Agitha",
  "192.17.0" => "Agitha",
  "192.18.0" => "Midna",
  "192.19.0" => "Midna",
  "192.20.0" => "Agitha",
  "192.21.0" => "Lana",
  "193.0.0" => "Lana? Whatever are you doing here?",
  "193.1.0" => "Cia--!",
  "193.2.0" => "She's the one! I'm cursed to look like this because of HER!",
  "193.3.0" => "Well, if I may say, that look suits you. Quite
fitting for a big-headed princess of Twilight...",
  "193.4.0" => "You--!",
  "193.5.0" => "Aaaagghh!",
  "193.6.0" => "Haaaaa...",
  "193.7.0" => "Lana, her face... It looks just like yours...",
  "193.8.0" => "I am Cia's...other half. She and I were once the same person.",
  "193.9.0" => "WHAT?!",
  "193.10.0" => "Cia",
  "193.11.0" => "Lana",
  "193.12.0" => "Midna",
  "193.13.0" => "Cia",
  "193.14.0" => "Midna",
  "193.15.0" => "Cia",
  "193.16.0" => "Cia",
  "193.17.0" => "Midna",
  "193.18.0" => "Lana",
  "193.19.0" => "Midna",
  "194.0.0" => "My name is Fi.
I was waiting for you.",
  "194.1.0" => "You are not the Master, but I can consider you a Master.",
  "194.2.0" => "My mission is to serve you.",
  "194.3.0" => "My assistance is necessary for your success.",
  "194.4.0" => "Shall I accompany you?",
  "194.5.0" => "Fi",
  "194.6.0" => "Fi",
  "194.7.0" => "Fi",
  "194.8.0" => "Fi",
  "194.9.0" => "Fi",
  "195.0.0" => "Oh, has the enemy figured out my plans?",
  "195.1.0" => "How unpleasant!",
  "195.2.0" => "Truthfully, I feel annoyed.",
  "195.3.0" => "If they can't learn to follow my direction...
then I shall do away with them!",
  "195.4.0" => "Ghirahim",
  "195.5.0" => "Ghirahim",
  "195.6.0" => "Ghirahim",
  "195.7.0" => "Ghirahim",
  "196.0.0" => "Master, raise your sword skyward, and then swing it down.",
  "196.1.0" => "Fi",
  "197.0.0" => "I see that your Triforce has returned...",
  "197.1.0" => "Yes. Mine, and Link's, too...",
  "197.2.0" => "It's not clear exactly how, but Cia's powers should be
a lot weaker.",
  "197.3.0" => "If we're going to counterattack, we've got to do it now!",
  "197.4.0" => "Cia still holds the Triforce of Power.",
  "197.5.0" => "She won't be overtaken so easily...",
  "197.6.0" => "No. We can win.
As long as we have the Master Sword.",
  "197.7.0" => "I believe Link possesses the spirit necessary to wield it.",
  "197.8.0" => "But, Princess...the Master Sword is more than just
a weapon--it's a barrier.",
  "197.9.0" => "It keeps a fragment of evil locked away.
Once pulled, the spirit will be freed...",
  "197.10.0" => "The barriers surrounding the Temple of the Sacred Sword
are made with a special type of magic.",
  "197.11.0" => "Pulling the Master Sword alone won't undo the barrier.
Not entirely, anyway.",
  "197.12.0" => "How can we be sure that Link is truly ready for this task?",
  "197.13.0" => "Because I believe in him.",
  "197.14.0" => "I believe in him too!",
  "197.15.0" => "Well, Link, if you were looking for a chance to prove yourself,
this would be it.",
  "197.16.0" => "Then we make haste for the Temple of the Sacred Sword.",
  "197.17.0" => "Lana",
  "197.18.0" => "Zelda",
  "197.19.0" => "Lana",
  "197.20.0" => "Lana",
  "197.21.0" => "Impa",
  "197.22.0" => "Impa",
  "197.23.0" => "Zelda",
  "197.24.0" => "Zelda",
  "197.25.0" => "Impa",
  "197.26.0" => "Impa",
  "197.27.0" => "Lana",
  "197.28.0" => "Lana",
  "197.29.0" => "Impa",
  "197.30.0" => "Zelda",
  "197.31.0" => "Lana",
  "197.32.0" => "Impa",
  "197.33.0" => "Zelda",
  "198.0.0" => "Tried hiding from me? Little brat...",
  "198.1.0" => "You fool!",
  "198.2.0" => "Wizzro",
  "198.3.0" => "Wizzro",
  "199.0.0" => "A sword is just a tool for the weak to swing around.
Only fools and men put confidence in them.",
  "199.1.0" => "Arrogance... Ego... Pridefulness...",
  "199.2.0" => "This darkness nurtured within you...",
  "199.3.0" => "shall be your undoing!",
  "199.4.0" => "Cia",
  "199.5.0" => "Cia",
  "199.6.0" => "Cia",
  "199.7.0" => "Cia",
  "200.0.0" => "Stand firm, Link!",
  "200.1.0" => "Real strength only comes from knowing your weaknesses!",
  "200.2.0" => "Lana",
  "200.3.0" => "Impa",
  "201.1.0" => "Uaaahhh!",
  "201.2.0" => "Allow me...to teach you a lesson!",
  "201.3.0" => "Hnnnnn...!",
  "201.4.0" => "Cia! Stop! Your spirit can't take much more of this!",
  "201.5.0" => "Cia",
  "201.6.0" => "Cia",
  "201.7.0" => "Cia",
  "201.8.0" => "Lana",
  "202.0.0" => "Follow my every command, or else perish again.",
  "202.1.0" => "Come. The Triforce shall be MINE!",
  "202.2.0" => "Ganondorf",
  "202.3.0" => "Ganondorf",
  "203.0.0" => "At last... All three pieces...",
  "203.1.0" => "Heh...",
  "203.2.0" => "HA HA HA HA!",
  "203.3.0" => "Ganondorf",
  "203.4.0" => "Ganondorf",
  "203.5.0" => "Ganondorf",
  "204.0.0" => "Grant my wish!",
  "204.1.0" => "Help! Everybody!",
  "204.2.0" => "Lana",
  "204.3.0" => "Lana",
  "363.0.0" => "Ha ha ha ha ha!",
  "363.1.0" => "I am the Great Fairy who serves the goddess.
I will grant you that which you wish for.",
  "363.2.0" => "Great Fairy",
  "363.3.0" => "Great Fairy",
}